# Allowlist for the public image build context (BuildKit prefers
# <Dockerfile>.dockerignore over .dockerignore). Only the generated publication
# bundle, the runtime verifier and the nginx config may enter the context: content/
# (and so every video), guide.html, the internal index.html and everything else are
# excluded by default, and .dockerignore's `**/dist` rule (which would strip
# dist/public) does not apply to this build.
*
!Dockerfile.public
!nginx.public.conf
!runtime/publish-runtime.sh
!dist/public
